# No secrets are currently required -- Novig's GraphQL endpoint
# (gql.novig.us) is public, same as the MLB model uses. This file exists so
# the pattern matches MLB-Model's .env.example and there's an obvious place
# to add credentials if Novig's API changes to require auth, or if a
# different odds source gets added later.

# NOVIG_GRAPHQL_URL=https://gql.novig.us/v1/graphql
